This library is super easy to use! all you need to do is download the Engine.js file and put it into your project.
next add <script src="Engine.js"> to your HTML file 
(if you have The Engine.js file in a seperate folder, then dont forget to add the path to the Engine.js file inside the "src" tag in the <script> tag)
also make shure to place the <script> tag above all your other scripts.

once you have done that, open the Engine.js file(if you want intelesence to work properly)
and refer to the "documentation" file on GitHub to understand how the library works!